00:00:01.829 --> 00:00:03.429 align:start position:0%
one of the most powerful men in las  vegas has died  las vegas sands ceo sheldon adelson  passed away last night after battling  non-hodgkin's lymphoma  adelson was 87 years old his funeral  will be held in  israel plans for memorial service here  in las vegas have not been announced  adelson was a self-made billionaire and  he leaves behind a huge legacy in the  gaming world not only here but over in  asia as well  he was also a major donor to the  republican party a philanthropist  and owner of the las vegas review  journal so what was  adelson's influence on modern day las  vegas and what is the legacy stretching  into the future  bianca holman spoke with a local gaming  historian for some perspective bianca  good afternoon  sheldon adelson owned the las vegas  sands corporation  those properties include the sands  convention center the palazzo the  venetian  and then you can see right here lit up  in front of the properties it says a  true visionary whose legacy lives on  at the venetian resort and around the  world and he had an incredible impact on  las vegas from casinos  to conventions his wife miriam adelson  and the las vegas fans both released  statements confirming his death last  night  just last week he announced he will be  stepping back from leading the las vegas  stands  to undergo more treatment adelson was  the son of jewish immigrants with the  relatively poor upbringing in boston  but over the course of his life he  created a number of businesses and grew  to become one of the world's richest men  he leaves behind a huge legacy in the  gaming world here in las vegas  china and singapore i think sheldon  adelson's legacy is going to be that  this is somebody who came to las vegas  and made a huge impact you know not just  in the gaming industry with his  properties  but also with his model the way he ran  them also with his philanthropy and i  think for some people this is going to  be the model of what  people do adelson donated to unlv  the substance addiction center recovery  clinic the adelson addiction  recovery clinic and the adelson  education campus which is a jewish  day school now there are plans for a  memorial service here in las vegas  a date will be released soon reporting  from near  spring mountain and las vegas boulevard  bianca holman  8 news now thank
 

